  "category": "Orthopedic Foot & Ankle / Podiatry",
  "description": "Medicare coverage criteria for surgical correction of hallux valgus (bunionectomy with osteotomy). Requires documented severe pain interfering with ambulation, weight-bearing hallux valgus angle > 15 degrees or 1st-2nd intermetatarsal angle > 9 degrees, and failure of conservative management (shoe modification, orthotics).",
